# Vulnerabilities the image scan (.github/workflows/security.yml) skips on purpose. Each one needs a reason, and
# must be reviewed again when the reason changes. Everything else HIGH or CRITICAL with a fix fails the scan.

# Spring Framework 6.2: fixed only in 7.x (Spring Boot 4); the free 6.2 line gets no more patches.
# Not exploitable here: the API only returns JSON. It has no XSLT views (CVE-2026-47884 needs XsltView) and no
# Server-Sent Events with view fragments (CVE-2026-47890). Real fix: move to Spring Boot 4.
CVE-2026-47884
